163
00:35:22,349 --> 00:35:31,749
囚われた屈辱は反撃の嚆矢だ 城壁のそのようになった獲物を屠る Yah!
The humiliation of being caged is the starting arrow of counterattack. Slaughter the prey trapped beyond the walls, Yah!

164
00:35:31,849 --> 00:35:36,649
ほとばしる衝動に その身を焼きながら
Burning your very body in the gushing impulse,

165
00:35:36,849 --> 00:35:43,849
黄昏に手を伸ばす 茜の弓矢
Reaching out to the twilight, the crimson bow and arrow!

166
00:36:05,049 --> 00:36:09,949
矢を背がえ追いかける奴らは逃がさない
We won't let the ones we chase escape,

167
00:36:10,049 --> 00:36:14,849
矢を放ち追い詰める決して逃がさない
Firing arrows and cornering them, never letting them escape!

168
00:36:15,049 --> 00:36:20,649
限界まで引き絞る八岐大蛇のソナズル
Drawing back to the limit, the sonorous thunder of Yamata no Orochi,

169
00:36:20,849 --> 00:36:25,749
限界が来たとしても何度でも放つ
Even if we reach our limits, we will release it again and again!

170
00:36:25,949 --> 00:36:30,849
獲物を屠るのは遠くでも傷でもない
What slaughters the prey is neither distance nor injury,

171
00:36:30,949 --> 00:36:36,849
研ぎ澄まされたお前自身の殺意だ
It is the honed intent to kill within yourself!

172
00:36:37,049 --> 00:36:44,649
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen! 炎のように熱く！
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen! Hot like flames!

173
00:36:44,749 --> 00:36:49,649
氷のように冷たく！
Cold like ice!

174
00:36:49,849 --> 00:36:54,849
己をやり込めて 全てを貫いてゆけ！
